#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:7053
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "We've got a spare portable shield diagnostic if you're interested. Engineers use these to get raw data on shield status. Why? well, sometimes they prefer the raw numbers over the normal percentages that appear. Would you like to get this for your engineer?"
