#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:7244
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "Not every ship in the fleet has a portable waypoint distance calculator. If you were to give us yours, we could install it on another ship if they wanted it. Would you like to give us your waypoint distance calculator?"
msgstr "No todas las naves de la flota tienen una calculadora portátil de distancia waypoint. Si usted nos diera el suyo, podríamos instalarlo en otro barco si lo quisieran. ¿Le gustaría darnos su calculadora de distancia waypoint?"

